rogrammer", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_normal.png?m=1733731195", "title": "程序员", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/programmer", "topics": 72899, "footer": "", "header": "While code monkeys are not eating bananas, they're coding.", "title_alternative": "Programmer", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_mini.png?m=1733731195", "stars": 9764, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 300, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 523153, "username": "mrergouwang666", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/mrergouwang666", "website": "https://buildorskip.dev/", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/560156422f6cd4318acece8fcb5e9884?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/560156422f6cd4318acece8fcb5e9884?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/560156422f6cd4318acece8fcb5e9884?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1607557290, "last_modified": 1787456408, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "kulove", "last_touched": 1787482975, "title": "我把全网在赚钱的站点变成了一张榜单", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236529", "created": 1787456430, "deleted": 0, "content": "以前找产品方向，我会在 Product Hunt 、X 、Reddit 收藏一大堆链接。\r\n\r\n但最后还是回答不了一个问题：\r\n\r\n这些产品只是有人讨论，还是真的在赚钱？\r\n\r\n所以我做了 Build or Skip （ buildorskip.dev)。\r\n\r\n现在站内收录了 14 万+ 在赚钱的产品，可以查看估算订单、增长状态、趋势、DR 、产品分类、定价、收入模式、广告平台和目标用户。\r\n\r\n现在我只需要看那个产品我能打得过，然后“先抄再超”就行了。\r\n\r\n![buildorskip.dev]( https://i.imgs.ovh/2026/08/23/7f8068e9064d0736490af3da77382199.png)\r\n\r\n![buildorskip.dev]( https://i.imgs.ovh/2026/08/23/4ff0a39115165f61d83b47ebd1a8cc6d.png)", "content_rendered": "<p>以前找产品方向，我会在 Product Hunt 、X 、Reddit 收藏一大堆链接。</p>\n<p>但最后还是回答不了一个问题：</p>\n<p>这些产品只是有人讨论，还是真的在赚钱？</p>\n<p>所以我做了 Build or Skip （ buildorskip.dev)。</p>\n<p>现在站内收录了 14 万+ 在赚钱的产品，可以查看估算订单、增长状态、趋势、DR 、产品分类、定价、收入模式、广告平台和目标用户。</p>\n<p>现在我只需要看那个产品我能打得过，然后“先抄再超”就行了。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"buildorskip.dev\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgs.ovh/2026/08/23/7f8068e9064d0736490af3da77382199.png\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"buildorskip.dev\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgs.ovh/2026/08/23/4ff0a39115165f61d83b47ebd1a8cc6d.png\"/></p>\n", "last_modified": 1787456430, "replies": 33, "id": 1236529}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_normal.png?m=1777132346", "title": "问与答", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna", "topics": 240984, "footer": "", "header": "<!--\r\n一个更好的世界需要你持续地提出好问题。\r\n-->", "title_alternative": "Questions and Answers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4509, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 84957, "username": "metrue", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/metrue", "website": "https://blog.minghe.me", "twitter": "_metrue", "psn": "", "github": "metrue", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/043a/5783/84957_mini.png?m=1785968845", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/043a/5783/84957_normal.png?m=1785968845", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/043a/5783/84957_large.png?m=1785968845", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/043a/5783/84957_xlarge.png?m=1785968845", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/043a/5783/84957_xxlarge.png?m=1785968845", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/043a/5783/84957_xxxlarge.png?m=1785968845", "created": 1417578487, "last_modified": 1785968845, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "metrue", "last_touched": 1787484087, "title": "2026 年键盘求推荐", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236534", "created": 1787459357, "deleted": 0, "content"