Pad</a>，<a href=\"/go/iphone\">iPhone</a>，<a href=\"/go/imac\">iMac</a> 及 <a href=\"/go/mbp\">MacBook Pro</a> 等电子产品的美国公司。", "title_alternative": "Apple", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6cdd/60ea/184_mini.png?m=1630643913", "stars": 3341, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 184, "parent_node_name": "hardware"}, "member": {"id": 643508, "username": "shenzhenhk", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/shenzhenhk", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e42f/4275/643508_mini.png?m=1773753292", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e42f/4275/643508_normal.png?m=1773753292", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e42f/4275/643508_large.png?m=1773753292", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e42f/4275/643508_xlarge.png?m=1773753292", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e42f/4275/643508_xxlarge.png?m=1773753292", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e42f/4275/643508_xxxlarge.png?m=1773753292", "created": 1691985601, "last_modified": 1773753292, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "Potatooo", "last_touched": 1787487036, "title": "很多过去认为在 apple 上不可能的实现的事现在都实现了", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236556", "created": 1787465904, "deleted": 0, "content": "以前大家都认为\r\n\r\n* iOS 绝对不可能开放通话录音，因为这在很多国家是违法的。结果现在可以了。\r\n* carplay 绝对不可能看视频，因为这是危及行车安全的。结果 WWDC26 上也说可以了。\r\n\r\n下一个不可能到可能的功能会是什么？", "content_rendered": "以前大家都认为<br /><br />* iOS 绝对不可能开放通话录音，因为这在很多国家是违法的。结果现在可以了。<br />* carplay 绝对不可能看视频，因为这是危及行车安全的。结果 WWDC26 上也说可以了。<br /><br />下一个不可能到可能的功能会是什么？", "last_modified": 1787465904, "replies": 27, "id": 1236556}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_normal.png?m=1777132346", "title": "问与答", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna", "topics": 240984, "footer": "", "header": "<!--\r\n一个更好的世界需要你持续地提出好问题。\r\n-->", "title_alternative": "Questions and Answers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4509, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 655652, "username": "YaD2x", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/YaD2x", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a2fe32cd7e7f224016ee299e235f7d40?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a2fe32cd7e7f224016ee299e235f7d40?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a2fe32cd7e7f224016ee299e235f7d40?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1697812766, "last_modified": 1766556407, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "saigetsu", "last_touched": 1787486713, "title": "关于楼上渗水到楼下的问题，请友友们提供一些建议。", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236528", "created": 1787456376, "deleted": 0, "content": "首先，我是楼上的住户。\r\n\r\n楼下住户最近装修，拆了吊顶后发现楼上卫生间淋浴间地漏附近有水渗下去，周围有明显被水浸泡的痕迹。\r\n\r\n昨天咸鱼找师傅过来看了一下，给我一个方案。似乎是用一种液体胶水混合水之后覆盖在瓷砖上，然后让液体顺着有缝隙的地方流进去，等到干固之后就能够把缝隙填充，解决渗水的问题。\r\n\r\n不知道这个方案是不现在比较主流的一种方法，关于费用，他报价在 2000 元左右。\r\n\r\n友友们有没有过类似的经历呀？\r\n\r\n关于这个价格和方案靠谱吗？\r\n\r\n拍的一张图片\r\n\r\n![0cb696fb86fd4a8265d26e8a82a63d83.jpg]( https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/08/23/QxzuUlZP.jpg)", "content_rendered": "<p>首先，我是楼上的住户。</p>\n<p>楼下住户最近装修，拆了吊顶后发现楼上卫生间淋浴间地漏附近有水渗下去，周围有明显被水浸泡的痕迹。</p>\n<p>昨天咸鱼找师傅过来看了一下，给我一个方案。似乎是用一种液体胶水混合水之后覆盖在瓷砖上，然后让液体顺着有缝隙的地方流进去，等到干固之后就能够把缝隙填充，解决渗水的问题。</p>\n<p>不知道这个方案是不现在比较主流的一种方法，关于费用，他报价在 2000 元左右。</p>\n<p>友友们有没有过类似的经历呀？</p>\n<p>关于这个价格和方案靠谱吗？</p>\n<p>拍的一张图片</p>\n<p><img alt=\"0cb696fb86fd4a8265d26e8a82a63d83.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/08/23/QxzuUlZP.jpg\"/></p>\n", "last_modified": 1787456376, "replies": 24, "id": 1236528}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_large.png?m=1733731195", "n